These enemies have the ability to afflict cats with the Curse effect, which disables [[Special Abilities]] that target enemies by trait (Weaken, Freeze, Slow, Attacks Only, Strong Against, Resistant, Insanely Tough, Massive Damage, Insane Damage, Knockback, Dodge Attack, Warp and Curse). Most of these enemies are [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relics]].
